# Pairs with TypeOK. The cold load's read of the durable entry is not load-bearing for
# the straddler fence on its own: the floor the load takes covers every purged
# generation (see the refinement note). The read is perturbed here against its domain.
MODULE: TypeOkColdLoadReadPastGenerationDomain
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the cold load reads a value past the generation domain
PERTURBS: ColdLoadRead

--- FIND
    /\ rd' = [rd EXCEPT ![i] = entryRow[i]]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: a read past the generation domain.
    /\ rd' = [rd EXCEPT ![i] = entryRow[i] + MaxGen + 2]
--- END
